    Assertion:the-whole-account-crosses,sentence:the whole account crosses the sealed channel — through seal unseal and import the vessel re-exports byte-identical to the captain
    Assertion:the-secret-never-rides,sentence:the secret never rides in clear — the sealed frame the relay carries holds no private key for an eavesdropper to lift
    Assertion:the-code-gates-who,sentence:the code gates who is made — a wrong code cannot open the frame so no account lands at the far end
    Assertion:the-keys-ride-c,sentence:the keys ride .c only even across transit — the landed account thaws its keypair onto .c and keeps no key scalar in its snap
